{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53593","headline":"咏廿四气诗 立冬十月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 立冬十月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜降向人寒，轻冰渌水漫。\n蟾将纤（一作「轻」）影出，雁带几行残。\n田种收藏了，衣裘制造看。\n野鷄投水日，化蜃不将难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}